sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/claim/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-code-traceability> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/assessment/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "@drmichaellevin 8-law mathematical synthesis & biological-law-criteria suite — Code-to-model traceability: 78/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-24"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Positives: every math-KG locus now starts at the declaration or `def` it cites and lies within its file (checked programmatically; `verify_integrity.py --loop-yaml` passes) (closes R6); docs/bioelectricity/ levin_youtube_kg.json is regenerated for the 8-law suite with schema 3.0.0, 17 concepts, a criteria rubric and the v2 referee block (closes R5); verify_integrity.py implements check_math_kg_loop_yaml and a conclusion-aware Lean classifier, LOOPS_MATH_DIR is used, `loan_body` is gone (closes R10's code part); the suite's own classifier applies the same bound-name-in-conclusion rule (L142-L153); C4 is claimed only by Laws 4 and 8 and C2 is withdrawn from Laws 5 and 7, consistently in the script, YAML, docs and KG (closes R8); the O1/O2 and T1-T4 counts agree across the four artefacts; both Lean modules compile with 0 sorry. Deductions: the written record disagrees with the code in at least seven places - criteria doc L62 (+0.7618), L64 / YAML L112 / KG L583 (0.0020 -> 0.9036), script L12 (101 values), L13-L14 and L182-L183 (Hill fit + RMS), L25 (alpha 0.95), L33-L35 (plasticity, extinction), L461-L469 (different ODE and results) (-10); the KG payload's `verified_measurements` is the referee's Pass 3 sidecar describing superseded code, and no generator script for the payload exists (-5); C3 for Laws 4, 5, 7 rests on the soft 'in the primary source' clause with a single implemented_by each (-3); MathOfBiology.lean section 17 is a maintained textual duplicate rather than an import (-2); the Lean classifiers are regex-based and would still accept a conclusion that mentions a bound name trivially (-2)." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "docs/BIOLOGICAL_LAW_CRITERIA.md L33–L33: C4 rule still cites 'alpha_bias -> 0.95' as the regime-crossing example; the code sweeps to 0.90 (L390) and the table (L62) reports a slope value the code does not produce <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/docs/BIOLOGICAL_LAW_CRITERIA.md#L33-L33>",
            "docs/bioelectricity/levin_youtube_kg.json L583–L583: Law 6 role text '0.0020 pre-training -> 0.9036 post-training' in the regenerated payload; the payload's own domain_summary (L1150) records intervened_metric_pre 0.0015 and metric 1.0 for the same law - the file contradicts itself <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/docs/bioelectricity/levin_youtube_kg.json#L583-L583>",
            "docs/bioelectricity/levin_youtube_kg.json L672–L686: verified_measurements = this referee's Pass 3 sidecar (meas_id ...-v3-...-m1 .. m22) copied verbatim, including 'Law 1 is the v2 one-point formula with an unused solver' and 'slope -0.1556'; stale with respect to the Pass 3.1 code the payload otherwise describes. No script generates the payload <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/docs/bioelectricity/levin_youtube_kg.json#L672-L686>",
            "models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py L757–L757: Law 4 criteria_passed C1, C2, C3, C4 with implemented_by = this script only (L758): C3 ('>= 2 implementations or cross-substrate validation in the primary source') rests on the soft clause; same for Laws 5 and 7 (single implemented_by) <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py#L757-L757>" ;
        pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-code-traceability-1>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-code-traceability-2>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-code-traceability-3>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-code-traceability-4>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-code-traceability-5>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-code-traceability-6>,
            <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-code-traceability-7> ;
        pk:hasScore "0.78"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-code-traceability-1> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "morphoeval/math_kg_loops/levin-youtube-channel-math.yaml L12–L28" ;
        dct:description "Law 1: lean_locus L30-L60 (decl at L30, theorem L41), code_locus L177-L225 (def at L177). Same pattern verified for all 8 laws: lean loci start at L30/71/107/137/168/196/235/262, code loci at L177/231/283/337/410/455/410/546; Law 8 lean_locus L262-L288 within the 290-line file. Closes R6" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/morphoeval/math_kg_loops/levin-youtube-channel-math.yaml#L12-L28> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-code-traceability-2> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "morphoeval/verify_integrity.py L197–L254" ;
        dct:description "check_math_kg_loop_yaml: parses '#Ls-Le', checks existence and 1 <= s <= e <= len(lines), requires lean_decl and lean_theorem short names inside the lean slice and a `def ` inside the code slice, and classifies lean_code. `--loop-yaml` on the Levin YAML: 0 violations (reproduced). Closes R10's dead-code finding" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/morphoeval/verify_integrity.py#L197-L254> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-code-traceability-3> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "morphoeval/verify_integrity.py L170–L187" ;
        dct:description "classify_lean_theorem_signature: splits at the depth-0 colon (L143-L167), collects bound names from `(x y : T)` groups and returns 'structural' only if one appears in the conclusion (or the conclusion has ∀). `theorem t (x : Nat) : 2 + 2 = 4` is now ground_arithmetic" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/morphoeval/verify_integrity.py#L170-L187> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-code-traceability-4> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py L142–L153" ;
        dct:description "Suite classifier applies the same rule (bound name must appear in the conclusion); 8/8 structural, kernel exit 0 (reproduced). all_lean4_verified (L855) is derived from these, not a literal" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/models/2026-levin-channel-math-synthesis.py#L142-L153> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-code-traceability-5> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "docs/bioelectricity/levin_youtube_kg.json L1–L12" ;
        dct:description "schema_version 3.0.0, total_laws 8, channel_concepts_indexed 17, all_lean4_verified true, lean_verification / catalog_verification blocks with the pinned hash; verified_laws has 8 entries with lean_locus, code_locus, criteria_passed, implemented_by. Closes R5" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/docs/bioelectricity/levin_youtube_kg.json#L1-L12> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-code-traceability-6> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "docs/BIOLOGICAL_LAW_CRITERIA.md L58–L66" ;
        dct:description "Law table: C4 only on Laws 4 and 8; C2 absent from Laws 5 and 7; O1 5 / O2 3 / T1 2 / T2 3 / T4 3 agree with script L705-L821, the YAML and the KG payload (checked). Closes R8" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/docs/BIOLOGICAL_LAW_CRITERIA.md#L58-L66> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-levin-youtube-channel-math-code-traceability-7> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
        rdfs:label "morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_levin_youtube_channel_math.lean L20–L290" ;
        dct:description "The 8 Levin theorems in Loop_levin_youtube_channel_math.lean; compiles, 0 sorry (reproduced, lean 4.35.0)" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/1969a7ea/morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_levin_youtube_channel_math.lean#L20-L290> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/model/claude-fable-5-1> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Claude Fable 5.1 (Anthropic; independent cross-provider MorphoEval referee, Pass 3 / 3.1)" ;
        dct:identifier "claude-fable-5-1" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://www.anthropic.com> .
}

